      <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Wendt Scholars' Reflections</h2>
      <p>Being a Wendt Scholar is a privilege, and I think that knowing it is a privilege has really motivated me in all the decisions I make.</p>
      <p>When I make decisions I don’t only think how does this look for my reputation, but also does this look like a good thing for a Wendt Scholar to do?</p>
      <p>I make sure that I put 100% effort into every thing I do not only for myself, but also because I am a Wendt Scholar and that is what we do. I am not only representing my own name but also the Wendt name.</p>
